----- stdout -----
Format a JSONC file

Usage: jsoncfmt format [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  Path to the JSONC file to format

Options:
  -s, --sort-keys <SORT_KEYS>        Sort object keys recursively [default: true] [possible values: true, false]
  -i, --in-place <IN_PLACE>          Replace the input file instead of writing to stdout [default: false] [possible values: true, false]
      --indent-width <INDENT_WIDTH>  Number of spaces per indentation level [default: 2]
  -h, --help                         Print help

